  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>alfentanil</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>N01AH02</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>two compartments, IV dosing <small>(PK_2C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Helmers H et al. 1984</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>elderly surgical patients</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>alfentanil</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_alfentanil/Alfentanil_Helmers1984_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>Apparent volumes of distribution of the central compartment ... in young adults and in elderly subjects</td><td>201</td><td>ml/kg</td><td><small>V1</small></td></tr><tr><td>Apparent volumes of distribution ... at steady state ... in young adults and in elderly subjects</td><td>460</td><td>ml/kg</td><td><small>Vss</small></td></tr><tr><td>Apparent volumes of distribution ... of the AUC ... in young adults and in elderly subjects</td><td>746</td><td>ml/kg</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr><tr><td>Plasma clearance ... in elderly subjects</td><td>4.4</td><td>ml/min/kg</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr><tr><td>terminal plasma t1/2 ... in the elderly patients</td><td>137</td><td>min</td><td><small>t1/2z</small></td></tr><tr><td>Fentanyl Mean v 2</td><td>275.7</td><td>litre</td><td><small>V2</small></td></tr><tr><td>central clearance</td><td>41.2</td><td>ml/min/kg</td><td><small>Q</small></td></tr><tr><td>t lag , min</td><td>0.96</td><td>min</td><td><small>tlag</small></td></tr></table><h4>About alfentanil</h4><p>Alfentanil is an opioid used as an intravenous anesthetic for general anesthesia and pain control. It is an approved medicine used mainly in hospital settings for anesthesia, though it is also a controlled drug with illicit misuse potential.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q176533\">Wikidata Q176533</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Alfentanil\">Alfentanil</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Helmers H et al. (1984). Alfentanil kinetics in the elderly. <i>Clinical pharmacology and therapeutics 36(2):239–243</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/clpt.1984.169\">10.1038/clpt.1984.169</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/6146424\">6146424</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Helmers_1984: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
